@startuml GoClaw Agent Pipeline Sequence
title GoClaw — Agent Pipeline: Message Processing Sequence

actor User
participant "Gateway\n(WS/HTTP)" as GW
participant "Scheduler" as SCH
participant "Pipeline\nOrchestrator" as PIPE
participant "Context Stage" as CTX
participant "Think Stage\n(LLM)" as THINK
participant "Act Stage\n(Tools)" as ACT
participant "Memory Stage" as MEM
participant "LLM Provider" as LLM
participant "Tool" as TOOL
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

User -> GW: chat(agentKey, message, sessionKey)
GW -> GW: authenticate + scope check
GW -> SCH: enqueue(task, lane=main)
SCH -> PIPE: run(RunState)

note over PIPE: Stage 1: Context
PIPE -> CTX: run(state)
CTX -> DB: load agent_context_files\n+ user_context_files
CTX --> PIPE: state.ContextFiles populated

note over PIPE: Stage 2: History
PIPE -> DB: load messages(sessionKey, L0)
note right: L1/L2 loaded if context budget allows

note over PIPE: Stage 3: Prompt Assembly
PIPE -> PIPE: assemble system prompt\n(SOUL.md + IDENTITY.md + context)

note over PIPE: Stage 4: Think
PIPE -> THINK: run(state)
THINK -> LLM: stream(messages, tools)
LLM --> THINK: SSE chunks (content + tool_calls)
THINK --> PIPE: state.Response + state.ToolCalls

alt No tool calls
    note over PIPE: Skip Act/Observe — go to Memory
else Has tool calls
    note over PIPE: Stage 5: Act
    PIPE -> ACT: run(state)
    loop each tool call
        ACT -> TOOL: execute(params)
        TOOL --> ACT: result
    end
    ACT --> PIPE: state.ToolResults

    note over PIPE: Stage 6: Observe\n(re-enter Think with tool results)
    PIPE -> THINK: run(state, withToolResults)
    THINK -> LLM: stream(messages + tool_results)
    LLM --> THINK: final response
    THINK --> PIPE: state.Response (final)
end

note over PIPE: Stage 7: Memory
PIPE -> MEM: run(state)
MEM -> DB: write working memory
MEM -> DB: trigger episodic consolidation event

note over PIPE: Stage 8: Summarize / Finalize
PIPE -> DB: update session stats
PIPE -> GW: stream event chunks to client

GW --> User: streaming response + final result

@enduml
